          "sentences": 1,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": 700,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "十二年陪伴，突然没了，心里肯定空了一块。它走的时候，您是在身边陪着它的吗？",
          "chars": 32,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": 803,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "这习惯太深了，倒完才反应过来，心里肯定更难受。十二年的陪伴，哪能说忘就忘呢。",
          "chars": 33,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": 1728,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "十二年陪伴，早就是家人了。为它难过，是重情义，不是没出息。",
          "chars": 24,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 741,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "kind": "followup",
          "text": "它陪您十二年，这份情意沉甸甸的。",
          "chars": 14,
          "sentences": 1,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": null,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "kind": "followup",
